20Conformity/","source-block-198","22. Declaration of Conformity",[]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/01%20FCC/","source-block-185","22.1 FCC",[]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/01%20FCC/","source-block-301","The unit meets FCC Part 15 requirements. Use is subject to two conditions:",["22.1 FCC"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/01%20FCC/","source-block-379","The unit must not cause harmful interference.",["22.1 FCC","The unit meets FCC Part 15 requirements. Use is subject to two conditions:"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/01%20FCC/","source-block-429","The unit must accept interference it receives, including interference that may cause undesired operation.",["22.1 FCC","The unit meets FCC Part 15 requirements. Use is subject to two conditions:"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/01%20FCC/","source-block-539","Responsible party in the United States",["22.1 FCC"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/01%20FCC/","source-block-584","Zedra, 185 Alewife Brook Parkway, , Cambridge, MA 02138",["22.1 FCC","Responsible party in the United States"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/01%20FCC/","source-block-648","Telephone: +1 857 285 5953",["22.1 FCC","Responsible party in the United States"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/01%20FCC/","source-block-679","Trade name: ARTURIA",["22.1 FCC"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/01%20FCC/","source-block-702","Model: MicroFreak",["22.1 FCC"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/01%20FCC/","source-block-723","Testing found the unit within the FCC limits for a Class B digital device. Those limits aim to provide reasonable protection from harmful interference in residential installations.",["22.1 FCC"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/01%20FCC/","source-block-907","If the unit interferes with radio or television reception, try these measures:",["22.1 FCC"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/01%20FCC/","source-block-989","Reorient or relocate the receiving antenna.",["22.1 FCC","If the unit interferes with radio or television reception, try these measures:"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/01%20FCC/","source-block-1037","Increase the distance between the unit and receiver.",["22.1 FCC","If the unit interferes with radio or television reception, try these measures:"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/01%20FCC/","source-block-1094","Connect the unit to an outlet on a different circuit from the receiver.",["22.1 FCC","If the unit interferes with radio or television reception, try these measures:"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/01%20FCC/","source-block-1170","Ask the dealer or an experienced radio/TV technician for help.",["22.1 FCC","If the unit interferes with radio or television reception, try these measures:"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/02%20Canada/","source-block-242","22.2 Canada",[]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/02%20Canada/","source-block-258","The Class B digital apparatus complies with Canadian ICES-003.",["22.2 Canada"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/02%20Canada/","source-block-324","The French statement declares that Class B digital apparatus complies with Canadian standard NMB-003.",["22.2 Canada"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/03%20CE/","source-block-247","22.3 CE",[]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/03%20CE/","source-block-259","Testing found the unit within the European Council limits for electromagnetic compatibility under Directive 2014/30/EU and low voltage under Directive 2014/35/EU.",["22.3 CE"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/04%20UKCA/","source-block-243","22.4 UKCA",[]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/04%20UKCA/","source-block-257","The unit meets the essential electromagnetic compatibility requirements of the UK Electromagnetic Compatibility Regulations 2016.",["22.4 UKCA"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/05%20RoHS/","source-block-245","22.5 ROHS",[]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/05%20RoHS/","source-block-259","The unit uses lead-free solder and meets the requirements of the RoHS Directive 2011/65/EU.",["22.5 ROHS"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/06%20WEEE/","source-block-238","22.6 WEEE",[]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/06%20WEEE/","source-block-252","The crossed-out wheeled-bin symbol",["22.6 WEEE"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/06%20WEEE/","source-block-491","This symbol indicates that the electrical and electronic equipment belongs at a collection point for treatment, recovery, and recycling, rather than in household waste. Follow national law and the WEEE Directive 2012/19/EU. For collection information, contact the local municipal office, household waste service, or the shop where the product was purchased.",["22.6 WEEE"]],["Microfreak/UG/22%20Declaration%20of%20Conformity/06%20WEEE/Asset/01-Crossed-out-Wheeled-Bin/png/","source-block-57","01 Crossed-out Wheeled Bin",[]],["Microfreak/UG/23%20Software%20License%20Agreement/","source-block-146","23 Software License Agreement",[]],["Microfreak/UG/23%20Software%20License%20Agreement/","source-block-180","Arturia (the Licensor) grants the Licensee a nonexclusive right to use this copy of the software in return for a license fee included in the purchase price. Arturia SA owns all intellectual property rights in the software. Copying, downloading, installing, and using the software are subject to this agreement.",["23 Software License Agreement"]],["Microfreak/UG/23%20Software%20License%20Agreement/","source-block-494","Product activation protects against unlawful copying. OEM software requires registration, and activation requires internet access.",["23 Software License Agreement"]],["Microfreak/UG/23%20Software%20License%20Agreement/","source-block-628","Installing the software means accepting these terms. If the terms are unacceptable, do not install it. Return the product, including all written material, complete undamaged packaging, and enclosed hardware, to the seller immediately and no later than 30 days after purchase for a refund.",["23 Software License Agreement"]],["Microfreak/UG/23%20Software%20License%20Agreement/01%20Software%20Ownership/","source-block-197","1. Software Ownership",[]],["Microfreak/UG/23%20Software%20License%20Agreement/01%20Software%20Ownership/","source-block-223","Arturia retains full title to the software and every copy, regardless of the media or form in which the original or copies exist. The license does not sell the original software.",["1. Software Ownership"]],["Microfreak/UG/23%20Software%20License%20Agreement/02%20Grant%20of%20License/","source-block-280","2. Grant of License",[]],["Microfreak/UG/23%20Software%20License%20Agreement/02%20Grant%20of%20License/","source-block-304","Arturia grants a nonexclusive license to use the software under this agreement.",["2. Grant of License"]],["Microfreak/UG/23%20Software%20License%20Agreement/02%20Grant%20of%20License/","source-block-387","The Licensee may not lease, lend, or sublicense the software. Network use is illegal where the program could be used simultaneously by multiple users.",["2. Grant of License"]],["Microfreak/UG/23%20Software%20License%20Agreement/02%20Grant%20of%20License/","source-block-541","The Licensee may make one backup copy for storage purposes only. The Licensee has no rights beyond those specified in the agreement; Arturia reserves all rights not expressly granted.",["2. Grant of License"]],["Microfreak/UG/23%20Software%20License%20Agreement/03%20Activation%20of%20Software/","source-block-286","3. Activation of the Software",[]],["Microfreak/UG/23%20Software%20License%20Agreement/03%20Activation%20of%20Software/","sou