Unbundling/","source-block-311","The software is licensed as one product, although the Licensee need not install or use every component. The Licensee may not rearrange components to create a modified version or new product, or modify the software configuration for distribution, assignment, or resale.",["5. No Unbundling"]],["Microfreak/UG/23%20Software%20License%20Agreement/06%20Assignment%20of%20Rights/","source-block-273","6. Assignment of Rights",[]],["Microfreak/UG/23%20Software%20License%20Agreement/06%20Assignment%20of%20Rights/","source-block-301","The Licensee may transfer all software-use rights to another person only if the Licensee transfers this agreement and the software or accompanying hardware, including all copies, upgrades, updates, backup copies, and previous versions that granted upgrade or update rights; retains none of those versions or copies; and the recipient accepts this agreement and the other rules under which the valid license was acquired.",["6. Assignment of Rights"]],["Microfreak/UG/23%20Software%20License%20Agreement/06%20Assignment%20of%20Rights/","source-block-725","After the transfer, the product cannot be returned because the recipient rejects the agreement, including its activation requirements.",["6. Assignment of Rights"]],["Microfreak/UG/23%20Software%20License%20Agreement/07%20Upgrades%20and%20Updates/","source-block-276","7. Upgrades and Updates",[]],["Microfreak/UG/23%20Software%20License%20Agreement/07%20Upgrades%20and%20Updates/","source-block-304","Using an upgrade or update requires a valid license for the previous or lower software version. Transferring that version to a third party ends the right to use its upgrade or update.",["7. Upgrades and Updates"]],["Microfreak/UG/23%20Software%20License%20Agreement/07%20Upgrades%20and%20Updates/","source-block-491","Acquiring an upgrade or update alone grants no right to use the software. Installing one ends support rights for the previous or lower version.",["7. Upgrades and 